    "Fit the whole width in the window (Shift 1)": ["Ajustar todo el ancho a la ventana (Mayús 1)","Ajustar a largura inteira à janela (Shift 1)","Ajuster toute la largeur à la fenêtre (Maj 1)","Ganze Breite ins Fenster einpassen (Umschalt 1)","幅全体をウィンドウに合わせる (Shift 1)","让整个宽度适应窗口 (Shift 1)","전체 너비를 창에 맞추기 (Shift 1)"],
